+		f2fs_free_filename(&fname);

Reason:
Adding `f2fs_free_filename(&fname)` immediately after the call to `f2fs_create_whiteout()` ensures that the memory allocated by `f2fs_setup_filename()` is properly freed before any possible early return, preventing the memory leak.

